53	/// A reserved slot for a hosted-tarball write. The publish flow writes
54	/// the decoded + verified tarball to `tmp_path` (a local file) inside a
55	/// blocking task, then promotes it to its final home — a rename on the
56	/// fs backend, an upload on the S3 backend — via
57	/// [`Storage::finalize_tarball_slot`], which recomputes the
58	/// destination from `name`/`filename`.
